    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18208" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφενος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>revenue, riches, wealth, abundance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφενος καὶ πλοῦτον ἀφύξειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.171
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.299
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρμηκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crates Theb.
					10.7
				</span></i>
			; of the <i>wealth</i> of the gods, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				112
			</span></i>: masc. acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφενον</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Op.</u>
				24
			</span></i>: gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οιο</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Jov.</u>
				96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.234
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφνος.</span></div>
